  "description": "The studio's night theme turned to autumn. Nocturne's deep plum ground, the same Spectral serif, and the same quiet violet-grey road hierarchy — but the accent moves from gold to one warm lantern amber, and the houses come forward as soft blocks with a lit edge. Built for the print-at-home neighbourhood sheet, where the streets are the walking route and the amber glyph is your own front door. No orange-and-black clip art: the poster still has to read as the same shop as Ink & Play.",
